#: inc/AI_Site_Assistant.php:186 views/dashboard.php:349
msgid ""
"For site results and rankings it uses data already in SEO Booster. It can "
"also explain SEO Booster features and basic SEO ideas. It does not crawl "
"live pages, change Google, or run tools for you. If unsure, it should say so."
